【Range Anomaly Troubleshooting Guide (Qingshu Mobility · Synthetic Knowledge) › 4. Escalation criteria】
- Same VIN calls in again ≥2 times within 30 days;
- Accompanied by battery temperature alert `BMS_OT_01`;
- User explicitly mentions media exposure intent → mark `TAG-reputation-risk` and escalate to specialist desk.

【Range Anomaly Troubleshooting Guide (Qingshu Mobility · Synthetic Knowledge) › 5. Shared-layer collaboration】
- Fill-ticket Skill must write `tag_id` (e.g. `TAG-short-range`) and `sentiment` in `AIOutput`;
- If `TAG-open-complaint` also exists, renewal Planning Skill should block outreach after reading it.

【Motor Noise and Speed Limit Handling (Synthetic) › Symptoms】
- Periodic hub motor noise during acceleration;
- Dashboard shows speed limit, max speed capped at 15 km/h;
- Occasional "drive system protection" popup.

【Motor Noise and Speed Limit Handling (Synthetic) › Agent forbidden phrases】
- Do not promise "we can definitely fix it same day";
- Do not guide user to remove motor end cap themselves.

【App Pairing Failure Troubleshooting (Synthetic) › Common causes】
1. Vehicle 4G not activated or connectivity service expired;
2. Phone Bluetooth/location permissions not enabled;
3. Factory binding from store not released;
4. Non-smart vehicle mistakenly routed through smart-vehicle pairing flow.

【App Pairing Failure Troubleshooting (Synthetic) › Process】
1. Look up VIN and confirm whether it is a smart vehicle;
2. Check renewal pool: if service expired, guide renewal before pairing;
3. Trigger backend "force unpair (store verification code required)";
4. Guide user to retry within 2 meters with App in foreground.

【Brake Noise and Pad Replacement Guide (Synthetic) › Assessment】
1. Ask mileage and recent maintenance;
2. Visual pad thickness check (threshold: replace if <2 mm);
3. Rule out embedded grit and slight disc rust after rain (common, not a fault).

【Charging Port and Charger Compatibility (Synthetic) › Troubleshooting】
1. Swap same-spec charger for trial;
2. Inspect charging port pins for burn marks or looseness;
3. Check telemetry for `CHG_OT_01`.

【Qingshu Mobility Warranty Policy Summary (Synthetic) › Battery】
- Lead-acid: 6-month capacity warranty;
- Lithium: 12 months or SOH≥80% warranty policy (illustrative);
- Damage from water ingress, unauthorized BMS tampering, or non-OEM chargers is not covered.

【Qingshu Mobility Warranty Policy Summary (Synthetic) › Service timelines】
- Urban scheduled onsite visit: respond within 48 hours;
- Parts out of stock: note expected arrival date on ticket and notify user.

【Qingshu Mobility Warranty Policy Summary (Synthetic) › Dispute escalation】
- User claims "unreasonable denial of warranty" → mark `TAG-warranty-dispute`;
- If public dissemination intent accompanies it, also mark `TAG-reputation-risk`.

【2026Q3 Pickup Rebate Policy (Synthetic) › Order review rules (illustrative)】
- When hero colors (matte black/star gray) are out of stock, suggest same-price-band substitute colors;
- Flame red long-term stockout—prioritize star gray substitute;
- Tier tier-up incentive reminders paused for tier-1 dealers with open P0 complaints.

【Store VI and Non-Exclusive Red Lines (Synthetic) › Prohibited】
- Mixed unauthorized competitor vehicles in same retail area (`TAG-non-exclusive-display`);
- Unauthorized changes to storefront primary color and standard fonts (`TAG-vi-violation`);
- Expired posters or wrong price tag templates.

【Store VI and Non-Exclusive Red Lines (Synthetic) › Inspection actions】
1. Vision/inspection produces flagged report;
2. Create remediation ticket with `due_date` and `verify_method`;
3. Two consecutive P0 violations may affect diamond-tier rebate eligibility.

【Agent QA SOP Highlights (Synthetic) › Required checks】
1. Verify VIN and model;
2. Restate user issue and confirm;
3. State next step and timeline;
4. Avoid absolute promises ("definitely", "absolutely no problem").

【Tier-1 Pickup and Color Stockout Scripts (Synthetic) › Red lines】
- Do not promise exact arrival date for unscheduled colors to tier-1 dealers;
- Do not proactively push tier-up incentives if P0 complaint is still open for that dealer.

【Store Opening Progress Checklist (Synthetic)】
1. County capacity and competitor share complete;
2. Fit-out grade recommendation matches support budget;
3. New dealer first order and month 1–3 pickup tracked;
4. Franchise risk grade is pass/supplement;
5. Opening Gantt owner and start/end dates in place.
